# ---------- Secrets & local output ----------
# Per-environment config holds the EOS client secret: never commit it. Keep a copy somewhere safe.
/Assets/_Project/Resources/Config/Environment_*.asset
/Assets/_Project/Resources/Config/Environment_*.asset.meta
# Editor screenshots
/Assets/Screenshots/
/Assets/Screenshots.meta

# ---------- Rewards server (never commit its config, state or secrets) ----------
/Server/rewards-api/config.json
/Server/rewards-api/node_modules/
/Server/rewards-api/*.env
/Server/rewards-api-install.txt

# LiveKit Unity SDK (third-party, ~280 MB with its native libraries): not in this repo. Get it with:
#   git clone https://github.com/livekit/client-sdk-unity Packages/io.livekit.livekit-sdk   (see Docs/12-handoff.md)
/Packages/io.livekit.livekit-sdk/
/Packages/io.livekit.livekit-sdk.meta
